abstract="Let Lk,mbe the set of formulas of first order logic containing only variables from x1, x2, . . . , xKand having quantifier depth at most m. Let Ck,m be the extension of Lk,mobtained by allowing counting quantifiers ∃ixj, meaning that there are at least i distinct xj's.",
